Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: Cardamom Bruises the Skillet
- Story & Context: In the freezing kitchen of Phuntsok Monastery, MC Kavi was frying whole spices when Abbot Choedak’s modular rig—patched to translate an elder's deep REM state into sub-bass CV oscillations—spat a stray voltage burst through an unshielded jack into an overdriven tube head. The sudden blast of sludge fuzz shook the stone shelves, scattering black seeds into smoking mustard oil just as Arvind struck up a frantic 16-beat Tintal on his Dayan to match the rhythm of the sputtering grease. Kavi dropped his spatula, seized an unvarnished ribbon mic, and spit an explosive double-time verse to tame the wall of sound before the circuit breakers could pop: "Cracked pan spitting oil while the tape deck grinds, reading holy visions out of modular lines." That afternoon of accidental fire and fuzz birthed the template for the entire movement, recorded entirely on an old cassette deck perched beside the flour bin.
